      "value": "Personally I don't mind the new UI. \nBut I'd like to just post an idea that mixes both - how about merging all sections into a single scrollable list just like in the stable version and make the new nav tabs behave as \"jump/scroll to section\". But it'd also require limiting the results for each section and adding a \"Show all\" button next to them.",
